            "text_line_3": "<p style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 18px;\">Sutex offers a selection of high-quality recycled fabrics made from ECONYL® yarn, a nylon yarn 100% recovered from industrial waste such as discarded fishing nets, carpet lint (surface of nylon carpets that have fulfilled their useful life).</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 18px;\">Nylon waste from landfills and oceans around the world is transformed into regenerated ECONYL® nylon. It's exactly like new nylon and can be recycled, recreated, and reshaped over and over again.</p>",
